Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.12,0:22:57.12,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H00&\bord0.1\blur5}寂しいよりも逢いたくて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.12,0:22:59.50,ed jp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H00&\bord0.1\blur5}死にそう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.37,0:22:14.45,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H00&\bord0.1\blur5}遇见你后
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.08,0:22:21.33,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H00&\bord0.1\blur5}每天都变得好短暂
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.63,0:22:26.71,ed zh,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H00&\bord0.1\blur5}我明明好好卸了妆
